41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Benjamin**: @Minako, I found that checking figures made people feel accused. We must avoid that trap.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Minako, distance doesn't fix the mess. I found it's often empty or dirty when I need it.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
