45,2,3,talk,Minako,,"- **Minako**: @Daisuke, the arranging time is real, but it’s a symptom. We need a structure that removes the need for constant negotiation.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Benjamin**: @Daisuke, the heavy weeks are exactly where the friction peaks. We need a system that absorbs those bursts without constant negotiation.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
